WEBVTT

00:01:57.661 --> 00:02:01.831
xayoliy bema'nilikka to'la 
holda aks etadi.

00:02:01.831 --> 00:02:05.634
Badiiy to'qima mahsuli – Makondo 
qishlog'ida yuz bergan afsonaviy hodisalar

00:02:05.634 --> 00:02:11.296
Kolumbiyada ro'y bergan hayotiy voqealar 
bilan mushtaraklik hosil qiladi.

00:02:11.296 --> 00:02:14.529
Yakkalangan afsonaviy manzilgoh 
asta-sekin tashqi dunyo bilan

00:02:14.529 --> 00:02:17.653
aloqaga kirishadi va buning asnosida

00:02:17.653 --> 00:02:20.391
ko'plab musibatlarga duch keladi.

00:02:20.391 --> 00:02:23.630
Yillar o'tishi bilan qahramonlar qarib, 
dunyodan o'tadilar,

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:25.783
ammo ularning sharpasi 
yana qishloqqa qaytadi

00:02:25.783 --> 00:02:29.722
yoki keyingi avlod qiyofasida 
qayta tug'iladilar.

00:02:29.722 --> 00:02:32.348
Shaharga Amerika meva kompaniyasi
bilan birga doim sariq